<details class="mb-4" x-bind:class="{glass: glass}" x-cloak>
  <summary>Submit New Pulls</summary>
  <ul>
    <li>Download the <a href="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mmgfrcs/ake-tracker/19a21ea3ae83b2bea035ca1111127eda09062eb9/get-record.ps1"><code>get-record.ps1</code></a> PowerShell script in the repo.</li>
    <li>On Windows: Right-click the script file &gt; Run with PowerShell &gt; Open</li>
    <li>Load the output JSON file here by clicking on the Choose File button below and selecting the <code>akerecord.json</code> file that is saved in the same folder the script is run on, then click Load File</li>
  </ul>
  <blockquote>
    Script pinned to commit <a href="https://github.com/mmgfrcs/ake-tracker/commit/19a21ea3ae83b2bea035ca1111127eda09062eb9"><code>19a21ea3ae83b2bea035ca1111127eda09062eb9</code></a> (Fix Empty Pool Types from the API)
  </blockquote>
  <form x-on:submit.prevent="loadUrl">
    <div class="mb-4" x-transition role="alert" data-variant="success" x-show="urlForm.message !== ''" x-text="urlForm.message"></div>
    <div class="mb-4" x-transition role="alert" data-variant="error" x-show="urlForm.error !== ''" x-text="urlForm.error"></div>
    <label data-field class="flex flex-col gap-2 w-fit">
      Record File<br />
      <input type="file" placeholder="Pick a file..." name="file" accept="application/json" required />
    </label>
    <button class="mb-4" x-bind:aria-busy="!urlForm.enableSubmit" data-spinner="small"
            x-bind:disabled="!urlForm.enableSubmit" type="submit">Load File</button>
  </form>
</details>